WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Currently,

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.020


00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:04.140
to the best of our knowledge, there is

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:08.000
nothing available in terms of a learning platform

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.680
that is catering to the specific learning needs

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.080
of somebody with a diagnosis or somebody with

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.300
neurodiversity.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:15.300


00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:22.720
This program is targeting specifically people with neurodiversity,

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:22.720


00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:26.440
all the topics cater to people with neurodiversity,

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:26.440


00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:30.060
all the methodology, cater to people with neurodiversity,

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:30.060


00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.420
the worksheets,

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:31.420


00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:34.840
the training materials, the language, the pace,

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:34.840


00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:38.250
the simplicity, the relevance, everything

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:38.250


00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.570
is catering to this very unique audience.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.570


00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:48.320
The mission of this LMS is to meet

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.660
neurodiverse learners where they are and teach them

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:54.200
in a style that works for them.

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:54.200


00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:57.200
I think what the users will feel is

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:01.120
that here is something that has been simplified,

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:01.120


00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:04.980
modified and adapted to the special or the

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:08.760
specific learning needs of somebody with a diagnosis.

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:08.760


00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:11.200
As like I said before, there really is

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:15.940
nothing available particularly for this audience.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:15.940


00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:20.000
When I look back, I think the concept

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.540
of having an LMS platform or an open

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:25.900
learning platform or a learning management system specifically

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:29.180
for people with neurodiversity came into being with

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:32.220
a always experienced during COVID.

00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:32.220


00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:35.880
Even before the lockdown was announced in April

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.360
2020,

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:37.360


00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:42.200
in March itself, we had very consciously

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:42.200


00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:45.100
reached a conclusion that there is really nothing

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:48.740
available for this large population of people with

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:50.240
the diagnosis who are now going to be

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:52.360
sitting at home and are going to be

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:54.740
dependent on the schools to open up their

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:56.840
online learning platform for them.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:56.840


00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:59.840
This also came from my own experiences with

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:03.600
my two children who are neuro typical and

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.240
they could go online on YouTube and look

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:08.040
at so many activities that they could access

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:11.380
and they could experience and which kept them

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:14.560
occupied and there was nothing really available online

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:18.680
for your cost for our students where they

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:20.900
could even if it was something as simple

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:23.260
as doing an art activity or doing cooking

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:27.280
activity which was catered to their pace, their

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:30.240
speed and their cognitive ability, there was nothing

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.940
really available. So I think that what I

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:34.700
value I did for those three months of

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:37.740
lockdown having one free activity on Facebook which

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:40.460
was a live session with so many young

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:44.340
people with neurodiversity and their family participated in.

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:44.340


00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:47.120
I think that opened up the whole aspect

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:50.880
of yes, there are neurodiverse people who will

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:53.360
be able to learn from an online platform

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:55.920
as well. So I think the whole inception

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:59.920
or the seed for this learning platform came

